<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR RATES STEADY AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR RATES STEADY AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor rates were steady</p>
<p>at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday. The 12-month</p>
<p>rate fell one basis point to 3.37 percent.</p>
<p>					   May 16 fix	   May 15 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor			  3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor			  3.04 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor			  3.08 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor			  3.18 pct		3.18 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor			  3.28 pct		3.28 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor			 3.37 pct		3.38 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
